{"id":"10ec5adde873ef88","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-topo10-comeager-set-code.md","title":"ZFC Topo10 Comeager Set Code","display":"df-zfc-topo10-comeager-set-code — ZFC Topo10 Comeager Set Code","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-topo10-comeager-set-code","aliases":["58-df-zfc-topo10-comeager-set-code"],"display":"df-zfc-topo10-comeager-set-code — ZFC Topo10 Comeager Set Code","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-topo10-meager-set-code.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-topo10-comeager-set-code"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-topo10-comeager-set-code</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-topo10-comeager-set-code — ZFC Topo10 Comeager Set Code"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"93870bfe2a48922a\" href=\"?note=93870bfe2a48922a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-topo10-meager-set-code.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-topo10-meager-set-code.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\tau,A,F\\in V\">\\(X,\\tau,A,F\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S\\subseteq V^2\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74086485fba8d86f\" href=\"?note=74086485fba8d86f\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top5-topological-space.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10MeagerSetCode}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10MeagerSetCode}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"93870bfe2a48922a\" href=\"?note=93870bfe2a48922a\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-topo10-meager-set-code.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-topo10-meager-set-code.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ComeagerSetCode}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ComeagerSetCode}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}comeager\\text{-}set\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ComeagerSetCode}_S(A,X,\\tau,F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land A\\subseteq X\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10MeagerSetCode}_S(X\\setminus A,X,\\tau,F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}topo10\\text{-}comeager\\text{-}set\\text{-}code}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10ComeagerSetCode}_S(A,X,\\tau,F)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{ZfcTop5TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\n\\land A\\subseteq X\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTopo10MeagerSetCode}_S(X\\setminus A,X,\\tau,F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A code witnesses comeagerness exactly by coding the complement as a meagre set.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"